{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38623","headline":"闲居即事 · 陆翱","name":"闲居即事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"衰柳迷隋苑，衡门啼暮鸦。\n茅厨烟不动，书牖日空斜。\n悔下东山石，贫於南阮家。\n沈忧损神虑，萱草自开花。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆翱","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38623.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38623","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}